{"seq":1,"slug":"scaling-sharding","title":"可扩展与分片：一致性哈希、Party Affinity 与水平扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/engineering/scaling-sharding","wordCount":1300,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"可扩展与分片-一致性哈希-party-affinity-与水平扩展\">可扩展与分片：一致性哈希、Party Affinity 与水平扩展</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>一致性哈希</strong></td>\n<td>将 Room/Party ID 映射到虚拟哈希环，节点增减时只迁移局部数据（约 1/n）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Party Affinity</strong></td>\n<td>同 Party 成员使用 PartyID 作为路由键，路由到同一节点，减少跨节点广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>有状态路由</strong></td>\n<td>与无状态 LB 不同，请求必须路由到持有目标 Room Actor 的特定节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Redis Pub/Sub 广播</strong></td>\n<td>跨节点的房间事件广播通道，每个房间对应一个 Channel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>热点房间</strong></td>\n<td>高关注度比赛的大量观战连接，需要分层扇出广播架构处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>排水（Drain）</strong></td>\n<td>节点下线前停止接受新房间，等待现有房间自然结束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"大厅分片的必要性\">大厅分片的必要性</h2><p>单台 Lobby 服务器的承载能力有限。假设每个房间维护一个 WebSocket 连接池，每个连接约占 64KB 内存，单节点 8GB 内存上限约 12 万个并发连接。对于日活百万的游戏，高峰期同时在大厅的玩家可能超过 20 万，必须水平扩展。</p>\n<p>扩展大厅服务的核心挑战：<strong>有状态路由</strong>——Room Actor 驻留在特定节点，玩家的 WebSocket 请求必须路由到持有其所在 Room 的节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性哈希分片\">一致性哈希分片</h2><h3 id=\"基本思路\">基本思路</h3><p>将房间 ID 映射到哈希环上，每个 Lobby 节点负责哈希环的一段区间。新加入或离开的节点只影响局部映射（最多 <code>1/n</code> 的 Room 需要迁移），比简单取模（<code>room_id % n</code>）在扩缩容时迁移量小得多。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import &quot;github.com/serialx/hashring&quot;&#10;&#10;// 服务注册时维护哈希环&#10;type LobbyRouter struct {&#10;    ring     *hashring.HashRing&#10;    nodes    map[string]*NodeInfo  // 节点 ID → 连接信息&#10;    mu       sync.RWMutex&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (lr *LobbyRouter) addNode(nodeID, addr string) {&#10;    lr.mu.Lock()&#10;    defer lr.mu.Unlock()&#10;    lr.ring = lr.ring.AddNode(nodeID)&#10;    lr.nodes[nodeID] = &amp;NodeInfo{ID: nodeID, Addr: addr}&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (lr *LobbyRouter) removeNode(nodeID string) {&#10;    lr.mu.Lock()&#10;    defer lr.mu.Unlock()&#10;    lr.ring = lr.ring.RemoveNode(nodeID)&#10;    delete(lr.nodes, nodeID)&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (lr *LobbyRouter) getNodeForRoom(roomID string) (*NodeInfo, bool) {&#10;    lr.mu.RLock()&#10;    defer lr.mu.RUnlock()&#10;    nodeID, ok := lr.ring.GetNode(roomID)&#10;    if !ok {&#10;        return nil, false&#10;    }&#10;    return lr.nodes[nodeID], true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/serialx/hashring</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 服务注册时维护哈希环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LobbyRouter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ring     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hashring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HashRing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nodes    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NodeInfo</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 节点 ID → 连接信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu       </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RWMutex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nodeID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">addr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr.mu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lr.mu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr.ring </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lr.ring.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AddNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nodeID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr.nodes[nodeID] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NodeInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ID: nodeID, Addr: addr}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">removeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nodeID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr.mu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lr.mu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr.ring </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lr.ring.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RemoveNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nodeID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(lr.nodes, nodeID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNodeForRoom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">roomID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NodeInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr.mu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RLock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lr.mu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RUnlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nodeID, ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lr.ring.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(roomID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ok {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lr.nodes[nodeID], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"请求路由\">请求路由</h3><p>玩家加入房间时，API 网关或负载均衡器查询哈希环，将请求转发到正确节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"玩家 → API Gateway&#10;         ↓&#10;    查询 Room Router（哈希环）&#10;         ↓&#10;    转发到 Lobby Node #3（持有 room-123）&#10;         ↓&#10;    建立 WebSocket 连接\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>玩家 → API Gateway</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    查询 Room Router（哈希环）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    转发到 Lobby Node #3（持有 room-123）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    建立 WebSocket 连接</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果当前节点不持有目标 Room（如节点刚完成扩容，部分请求短暂路由错误），节点返回 <code>307 Temporary Redirect</code>，携带正确节点地址，客户端重定向：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (ls *LobbyServer) handleJoinRoom(roomID, playerID string) {&#10;    node, ok := ls.router.getNodeForRoom(roomID)&#10;    if !ok || node.ID != ls.myNodeID {&#10;        // 不是我负责的 Room，重定向&#10;        targetAddr := node.WebSocketAddr + &quot;/ws?room=&quot; + roomID&#10;        ls.respondRedirect(targetAddr)&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;    // 我负责这个 Room，处理连接&#10;    ls.acceptConnection(roomID, playerID)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleJoinRoom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">roomID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">playerID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    node, ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.router.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNodeForRoom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(roomID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.ID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.myNodeID {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 不是我负责的 Room，重定向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        targetAddr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.WebSocketAddr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"/ws?room=\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roomID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">respondRedirect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(targetAddr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 我负责这个 Room，处理连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">acceptConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(roomID, playerID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"party-affinity-路由\">Party Affinity 路由</h2><p>Party Affinity 是指同一 Party 的成员应尽量路由到同一个 Lobby 节点，以减少跨节点通信。</p>\n<h3 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h3><p>如果 Party 中的 5 个玩家分散在 3 个 Lobby 节点上，每次 Ready Check 状态变更都需要跨节点广播，延迟增加且实现复杂。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实现方案\">实现方案</h3><p>用 Party ID 作为哈希键（而非 Room ID），为 Party 的 Leader 加入的房间确定归属节点，其他 Party 成员跟随 Leader 进入同一节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (lr *LobbyRouter) getNodeForParty(partyID string) (*NodeInfo, bool) {&#10;    return lr.getNodeForRoom(partyID) // Party ID 哈希到同一节点&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 创建房间时：用 PartyID 决定房间归属节点&#10;func (ls *LobbyServer) createRoom(partyID string) (*Room, error) {&#10;    node := ls.router.getNodeForParty(partyID)&#10;    if node.ID != ls.myNodeID {&#10;        // 转发到负责此 Party 的节点创建房间&#10;        return ls.forwardCreateRoom(node, partyID)&#10;    }&#10;    return ls.localCreateRoom(partyID)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNodeForParty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">partyID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NodeInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNodeForRoom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(partyID) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Party ID 哈希到同一节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 创建房间时：用 PartyID 决定房间归属节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createRoom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">partyID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Room</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.router.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNodeForParty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(partyID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.ID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.myNodeID {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 转发到负责此 Party 的节点创建房间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forwardCreateRoom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, partyID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">localCreateRoom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(partyID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"跨节点广播\">跨节点广播</h2><p>即使有 Party Affinity，仍然存在不同 Party 成员在不同节点的情况（匹配系统凑的陌生人对局）。此时房间跨多个节点，需要跨节点广播层：</p>\n<h3 id=\"方案一-redis-pub-sub\">方案一：Redis Pub/Sub</h3><p>每个房间对应一个 Redis Channel，节点在处理完本地逻辑后，将广播消息 publish 到 Channel，所有订阅此 Channel 的节点（连接了属于此房间玩家的节点）收到消息后转发给本地 WebSocket：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 节点 A 处理了 PlayerReady 事件&#10;func (n *LobbyNode) publishRoomEvent(roomID string, event RoomEvent) {&#10;    data, _ := json.Marshal(event)&#10;    n.redis.Publish(&quot;room:events:&quot;+roomID, data)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 节点 B 订阅 room:events:room-123，收到后找出本地连接该房间的玩家，转发消息&#10;func (n *LobbyNode) subscribeRoomEvents(roomID string) {&#10;    sub := n.redis.Subscribe(&quot;room:events:&quot; + roomID)&#10;    for msg := range sub.Channel() {&#10;        var event RoomEvent&#10;        json.Unmarshal([]byte(msg.Payload), &amp;event)&#10;        n.deliverToLocalPlayers(roomID, event)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 节点 A 处理了 PlayerReady 事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publishRoomEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">roomID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RoomEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Marshal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n.redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"room:events:\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">roomID, data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 节点 B 订阅 room:events:room-123，收到后找出本地连接该房间的玩家，转发消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscribeRoomEvents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">roomID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sub </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n.redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"room:events:\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roomID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sub.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        json.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unmarshal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg.Payload), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        n.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">deliverToLocalPlayers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(roomID, event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方案二-grpc-点对点广播\">方案二：gRPC 点对点广播</h3><p>节点维护与其他节点的 gRPC 连接，直接点对点推送，延迟比 Redis Pub/Sub 低，但连接数随节点数平方增长（n 个节点需要 n*(n-1)/2 条连接）：适合小规模集群（&lt; 20 节点）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热点房间处理\">热点房间处理</h2><p>高关注度比赛（如职业选手组队、主播直播间）可能吸引大量观战者，形成热点房间（Hot Room）。</p>\n<p>热点房间的主要压力在于<strong>广播</strong>：每个事件需要推送给数千个观战 WebSocket 连接，单节点处理不过来。</p>\n<p>解决方案：<strong>分层扇出广播</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"主大厅节点（维护房间状态）&#10;    ↓ 发布事件到消息队列（Kafka / Nats）&#10;    ↓&#10;分发节点集群（每个节点负责一批观战者）&#10;    ↓ 各自广播给本地 WebSocket 连接&#10;观战者 1~1000  观战者 1001~2000  ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>主大厅节点（维护房间状态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 发布事件到消息队列（Kafka / Nats）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>分发节点集群（每个节点负责一批观战者）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 各自广播给本地 WebSocket 连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>观战者 1~1000  观战者 1001~2000  ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>主节点只负责状态维护和事件发布；分发节点只负责消费事件并推送给客户端，可以弹性扩展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩缩容的平滑迁移\">扩缩容的平滑迁移</h2><p>Lobby 节点扩缩容时，需要将受影响的 Room 迁移到新节点，同时不中断现有 WebSocket 连接：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>排水（Drain）</strong>：旧节点停止接受新 Room，现有 Room 逐渐自然结束</li>\n<li><strong>强制迁移</strong>：对于仍在等待的 Room，向玩家广播迁移通知，客户端重新连接到新节点</li>\n<li><strong>状态传递</strong>：旧节点将 Room Snapshot 序列化到 Redis，新节点从 Redis 恢复 Room Actor</li>\n</ol>\n<p>扩缩容时间窗口（通常深夜流量低谷）和自动扩缩容策略（基于 CCU / 内存使用率的 HPA）是大厅系统 Kubernetes 运维的标准实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性哈希路由架构图\">一致性哈希路由架构图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    C[玩家 WebSocket 请求] --&gt; GW[API Gateway]&#10;    GW --&gt; R{一致性哈希路由}&#10;    R --&gt;|&quot;hash(room-123) → Node1&quot;| N1[Lobby Node 1\\nRoom A, B, C]&#10;    R --&gt;|&quot;hash(room-456) → Node2&quot;| N2[Lobby Node 2\\nRoom D, E, F]&#10;    R --&gt;|&quot;hash(room-789) → Node3&quot;| N3[Lobby Node 3\\nRoom G, H, I]&#10;&#10;    N1 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;Redis Pub/Sub\\n跨节点广播&quot;| N2&#10;    N2 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;Redis Pub/Sub&quot;| N3&#10;    N1 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;Redis Pub/Sub&quot;| N3&#10;&#10;    N1 --&gt; RS[&quot;(Redis\\nRoom Snapshots)&quot;]&#10;    N2 --&gt; RS&#10;    N3 --&gt; RS\">graph TB\n    C[玩家 WebSocket 请求] --&gt; GW[API Gateway]\n    GW --&gt; R{一致性哈希路由}\n    R --&gt;|\"hash(room-123) → Node1\"| N1[Lobby Node 1\\nRoom A, B, C]\n    R --&gt;|\"hash(room-456) → Node2\"| N2[Lobby Node 2\\nRoom D, E, F]\n    R --&gt;|\"hash(room-789) → Node3\"| N3[Lobby Node 3\\nRoom G, H, I]\n\n    N1 &lt;--&gt;|\"Redis Pub/Sub\\n跨节点广播\"| N2\n    N2 &lt;--&gt;|\"Redis Pub/Sub\"| N3\n    N1 &lt;--&gt;|\"Redis Pub/Sub\"| N3\n\n    N1 --&gt; RS[\"(Redis\\nRoom Snapshots)\"]\n    N2 --&gt; RS\n    N3 --&gt; RS</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>大厅服务的水平扩展核心是一致性哈希分片：以 Room ID（或 Party ID）为路由键，将 Room Actor 稳定映射到特定节点，节点变动时只影响局部数据。Party Affinity 通过让同 Party 成员使用 PartyID 作路由键，使好友组整体落在同一节点，大幅减少跨节点广播开销。跨节点广播通过 Redis Pub/Sub 实现（适合 &lt; 50 节点），小集群可用 gRPC 点对点。热点房间用分层扇出架构（主节点发布 Kafka → 分发节点推送观战者），将广播压力从单节点分散到弹性集群。扩缩容采用排水+快照迁移策略，确保房间状态无损传递。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可扩展与分片：一致性哈希、Party Affinity 与水平扩展","id":"可扩展与分片-一致性哈希-party-affinity-与水平扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"大厅分片的必要性","id":"大厅分片的必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性哈希分片","id":"一致性哈希分片"},{"level":3,"text":"基本思路","id":"基本思路"},{"level":3,"text":"请求路由","id":"请求路由"},{"level":2,"text":"Party Affinity 路由","id":"party-affinity-路由"},{"level":3,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":3,"text":"实现方案","id":"实现方案"},{"level":2,"text":"跨节点广播","id":"跨节点广播"},{"level":3,"text":"方案一：Redis Pub/Sub","id":"方案一-redis-pub-sub"},{"level":3,"text":"方案二：gRPC 点对点广播","id":"方案二-grpc-点对点广播"},{"level":2,"text":"热点房间处理","id":"热点房间处理"},{"level":2,"text":"扩缩容的平滑迁移","id":"扩缩容的平滑迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性哈希路由架构图","id":"一致性哈希路由架构图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"观战与排队：Spectator Slot、队列优先级与实时推送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/matchmaking/spectator-queue"},"next":{"title":"断线重连：重连 Token、快照恢复与 Backfill 补位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/engineering/reconnect-recovery"}}